+# Holdback Schedule to the Master License (fictional)
+
+HS-2. PVOD may not begin before the holdback date listed for the title and
+territory.
+
+HS-4. Holdback dates are fixed calendar dates; a change to a theatrical date
+does not move them unless amended in writing.
+
+## Worked example, for the licensing desk
+
+Q: The German theatrical release of 'Quorum of Kites: Second Wind' has moved
+up two weeks, to 2026-12-03. PVOD usually follows theatrical by 45 days. Can
+we publish it on PVOD in Germany on 2027-01-20?
+
+A: No. Available: false. Exclusive: true. Constraint: holdback. The governing
+row is r-009 and the clause is HS-4: the holdback stays at 2027-02-01.
